Show a source summary; --json includes its editable URL

Usage: xrm sub show [OPTIONS] SOURCE_ID

POSITIONALS:
  SOURCE_ID (required)    Exact subscription name or source ID from sub list 

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm sub show SOURCE_ID
